              "summary": "The failed-jobs backlog indicates that there are issues with job processing, leading to 502 errors. Pgbouncer connection pool exhaustion was addressed by restarting the service, but further investigation is needed into the root cause of the failed jobs.",
              "recommended_next_step": "Review the failed jobs in the database and identify any common patterns or issues. Once identified, apply the necessary fixes to prevent future failures. Additionally, consider implementing better monitoring and alerting for job failures."
            }
